OL,3,GNEWSAHow an introvert became a
OL,4,Astoryteller
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanding before an audience and holding
OL,7,Ftheir attention for an hour or more
OL,8,Fmight sound like a nightmare to many
OL,9,Fintroverts.
OL,11,FFor Danielle Free, it once was.
OL,13,FThe storyteller, who lives in rural
OL,14,FShropshire, now performs around the
OL,15,Fcountry, bringing to life tales of
OL,16,Fhistory, folklore and landscape in
OL,17,Fvenues ranging from libraries and
OL,18,Fmuseums to ancient sites and windswept
OL,19,Fhillsides.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
